 * 00:05 (scheduleExamTagRefresh 957-965); listeners: 4 filtros,
 * click-outside/Escape/popstate dos 2 modais (history API pushState
 * 1042/1063 + replaceState 1053/1074 — verbatim §6.3); boot no fim:
